@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
title Player input dispatch (abstracted branches)
actor Player
participant "BYOND callback" as Engine
participant "atom.Click" as Atom
participant "mob.ClickOn" as Mob
participant "target subtype" as Target
participant "held item subtype" as Item
Player -> Engine : click atom / browser link
alt Atom click
Engine -> Atom : Click(location, control, params)
Atom -> Mob : usr.ClickOn(src, params)
Mob -> Mob : target / click clock / modifiers
alt Modifier shortcut
Mob -> Target : modifier-specific dispatch
else Ordinary action
Mob -> Mob : equipment / state / range gates
alt Held item and suitable range
Mob -> Target : attackby(item, actor)
Mob -> Item : afterattack(target, actor, adjacency, params)
else Empty hand or ranged action
Mob -> Target : UnarmedAttack / RangedAttack routing
end
end
else Browser href
Engine -> Engine : client.Topic validates usr matches mob
Engine -> Target : parent / native href target dispatch
end
note over Mob,Item
Overrides, queued callbacks and early returns affect actual paths.
Exact source determines authorization order.
end note
@enduml
